WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.846
Fellow citizens,
in obedience to the will of the people,

2
00:00:03.846 --> 00:00:09.615
and in their presence by the authority
vested in me by this oath I assume

3
00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:13.846
the arduous and responsible duties
of President of the United States.

4
00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:16.538
Relying upon the support of my countrymen,

5
00:00:16.538 --> 00:00:22.308
and invoking the guidance of Almighty God,
our faith teaches that there is no safer

6
00:00:22.308 --> 00:00:26.154
reliance than upon the God
of our fathers who has

7
00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:30.000
so singularly favored the American
people in every national trial

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
and who will not forsake us
so long as we obey his commandments

9
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.154
and walk humbly in his footsteps the respo
nsibilities of the high trust to which I

10
00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:46.538
have been called always of grave importanc
e are augmented by the prevailing business

11
00:00:46.538 --> 00:00:50.769
conditions entailing idleness upon willing
labor and loss to useful enterprises.

12
00:00:50.769 --> 00:00:55.385
The country is suffering from industrial
disturbances from which speedy relief must

13
00:00:55.385 --> 00:00:58.462
be had our financial
system needs some revision.

14
00:00:58.462 --> 00:01:03.846
Our money is all good now, but its
value must not further be threatened.
